        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lee Seung-gi\n- Works: My Girlfriend Is a Nine-Tailed Fox\n- Organizations: SBS\n- Concepts: Nicknames, hit songs\n\nFacts:\n- SBS aired My Girlfriend Is a Nine-Tailed Fox from August 11 to September 30, 2010, on Wednesdays and Thursdays at 22:00 for 16 episodes.\n- Lee Seung-gi is known as the \"Ballad Prince.\"\n- Lee Seung-gi has had hit songs including \"Because You're My Woman,\" \"Will You Marry Me,\" and \"Return.\"",
